{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "I tested a representative sample of the spent solvent yesterday and recorded a 54°C flash point. Based on that result, the current waste profile requires the shipment to be documented as waste code D001 and transported as UN1993, flammable liquid, n.o.s., Packing Group III. I completed the lab worksheet, but I should note it has not yet been attached to the waste file."}
```

